<title>UK: Irish Permanent sets two-tranche asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>Irish Permanent sets two-tranche asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish Permanent Treasury Plc has issued a two-tranche asset-backed FRN, lead manager UBS said on Monday.</p>
<p>Tranche A is for $150 million and tranche B for $200 million. Both are guaranteed by Irish Permanent Plc.  </p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/32	PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS/REOFF  99.943    FULL FEES   0.125</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.075     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	50 PCT WILL BE REDEEMED ON A PRO RATA BASIS IN MARCH</p>
<p>		2000 AND THE BALANCE IN MARCH 2002</p>
<p>		AVERAGE LIFE FOUR-YEARS. DISCOUNT MARGIN LIBOR PLUS</p>
<p>		FIVE B.P.</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 MAR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     10 BP     PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS/REOFF  99.824    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	DISCOUNT MARGIN LIBOR PLUS 12.75 B.P.</p>
<p> COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> LISTING    LON/IRE   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
